  "notable_quotes": [
    "Ni(II) derivatives are strong candidates for Haldane-chain studies because integer-spin systems show a singlet-triplet gap.",
    "The MOxim family can be doped with Zn(II) in any desired ratio, enabling isolated Ni(II) ions to be probed in the chain environment.",
    "The zigzag chain has octahedral metal centers with an MN2O4 donor set from two cis dmiz ligands and two cis tetradentate oxalates."
